            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked a preliminary procedural question, seeking a conclusive answer about a procedural matter."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0002-0010"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice questioned whether the interpretation of a contract could be separated from a violation of federal law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0002-0012"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked whether the state retains control over contract interpretation when the contract is governed by state law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice inquired whether district judges are parties to an appeal from their decisions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. McDowell",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. McDowell, justice asked whether the FCC\u2019s role in place of a state commission makes its decisions reviewable in federal court under the Hobbs Act."
      }
    ],
