        ],
        "text": "According to Paul M. Smith, paul M. Smith presented oral argument on behalf of the respondents, outlining the complaint that the ICC misinterpreted interconnection agreements and violated the Telecommunications Act and FCC rulings."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners (Mr. Bertocchi)",
        "citations": [
