            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners were represented by Joel D. Bertocchi, Solicitor General of Illinois; Respondent United States was represented by Barbara B. McDowell; and WorldCom Technologies and related companies were represented by Paul M. Smith."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners (Joel D. Bertocchi)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners (Joel D. Bertocchi), the Telecommunications Act of 1996 created competition in local telephone markets through sections 251 and 252, which impose interconnection obligations on incumbent carriers and set procedures for negotiating those agreements."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Paul M. Smith",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0002-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Paul M. Smith, respondents contend that the Interstate Commerce Commission misinterpreted interconnection agreements and that its order requiring reciprocal compensation violated the Telecommunications Act and applicable FCC rulings."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d5a4950198d9dfe4bc27b4b1df24696f23ea57b60a95ddaec5f7cedb5a0692c0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d5a4950198d9-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case was formally submitted to the Court."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
